: the billows of the sea are wonderful: the Lord is wonderful in high places.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Your testimonies are made very sure: holiness becomes your house, O Lord,","poem":1},{"noteId":183},{"text":"for ever.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":180,"caller":"+","text":"Alex. the sabbath-day.","reference":{"chapter":92,"verse":0}},{"noteId":181,"caller":"+","text":"Alex. + the floods will lift up their waves. See Heb.","reference":{"chapter":92,"verse":3}},{"noteId":182,"caller":"+","text":"q. d. in answer to.","reference":{"chapter":92,"verse":4}},{"noteId":183,"caller":"+","text":"Gr. to length of days.","reference":{"chapter":92,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_lxu/PSA/92.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_lxu/PSA/93.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_lxu/PSA/91.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}